SunshineOS live repair and migration environment.

Read-only first:
  sunshine-health --deep
  sunshine-sanity --require-snapshot
  sunshine-rescue
  sunshine-report

Mutating operations always require --apply and a rollback checkpoint:
  sunshine-update --apply
  sunshine-upgrade --apply --trust-index ... --trust-policy ... --trust-keyring ...
  sunshine-migrate --apply --source arch --trust-index ... --trust-policy ... --trust-keyring ...
  sunshine-repair --apply --reinstall-missing

Every command writes a JSON report under /var/log/sunshine/reports
and journals decisions in /var/log/sunshine/journal.jsonl.
